        "text": "Let’s work this parallel case through.\n\nTimes are 12, 10 and 6 months. Weights are 72,000 : 80,000 : 60,000, which simplify to 18 : 20 : 15.\n\nTry it once more. This time focus on the same relationship, not the surface story.",
